    "title": "Rhode Island grocery store hours for Easter 2026. See who's closed",
    "text": "GROCERY STORESMarket Basket closed on Easter Sunday and not the only ones. See listBailey AllenUSA TODAY NETWORK - New EnglandMarch 31, 2026, 5:16 a.m. ETNeed to grab some last-minute marshmallow Peeps or eggs to dye on Easter? What about that glazed ham? Many Rhode Island grocery stores will be open on Easter Sunday, but their hours may be limited.While no state laws prevent supermarkets from opening as usual on Easter, many opt to open with limited hours to allow employees to celebrate the holiday.If you purchase through our links, the USA Today Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
